- op: discuss  # 4217
  at: '2026-10-31T03:34:19Z'  # 4217
  by: agent  # 4217
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 4217
  clock: 3  # 4217
  nonce: '4217'  # 4217
  message: "Fixed in PR #1974 (a13e6cac1a): _sink_zone_gaps reports community_only_languages (every sink in the zone a community row) and _apply_sink_zone_gap withholds a clean verdict for them, per ADR-0061 ruling 2 (community rows may add findings, never make a verdict cleaner). Re-run on merged dev, live verify-claims on a two-function Haskell repo (fetch calls httpLbs on a literal URL; no input read), claim untrusted_input -> network: default inconclusive rc=2, details 'haskell has only community rows in the network zone, which may add findings but never make a verdict cleaner (ADR-0061 ruling 2)' (was confirmed); --no-default-overlays inconclusive rc=2 'no sink in the network zone' (unchanged). With getLine flowing into httpLbs: default violated rc=1 (the adding half stands). Catalogue-wide (haskell, network) is the only community-only pair; no corpus repo is Haskell, so no corpus verdict moves."  # 4217
